        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "text": "Beautiful home and very spacious and comfortable. The only complaint we had was that the water pressure in the main bedroom bathroom was nonexistent, it was barely dripping and was an unpleasant experience after beach days.",
        "title": "Beautiful Home"
      },
      {
        "author": "Jonathan R.",
        "date": "2025-09-28T23:08:34Z",
        "id": "68d9ce30d246c42885378023",
        "label": "Okay",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 6,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Oct 10, 2025",
            "id": "5f0b6412-0546-47a0-8dd3-046f241bda19",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for taking the time to share your feedback. We’re very sorry to hear that your stay didn’t meet expectations. While we’re glad you enjoyed the convenient beach access, we understand how frustrating it must have been to experience issues with the primary shower and hot water, and we truly apologize for that inconvenience.\n\nOur listings note that we provide a starter supply of soaps, paper goods, and basic essentials, though guests may wish to bring additional items for longer stays. We’ll also review your comments about kitchen supplies and linens with our team to ensure we’re maintaining the right stock for future guests.\n\nWe appreciate your perspective and will use your feedback to improve our guest experience moving forward.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "While the location of this property was great for getting to the beach (literally right across Highway 98), this property truly under-delivered.Flying in from Colorado, you would hope that a Vrbo host would have soaps, extra towels, extra blankets, I mean anything really! The house had no extra towels, no soaps, no spices in the kitchen, barely enough plates and bowls to feed our family during family dinners; and on top of that the primary shower and hot water didn’t work for two days.My family and I were very disappointed in this property and with how close it is to highway 98, it made falling asleep and getting my 10 month old asleep a real challenge with all the truck traffic at night.Overall I would not stay at this property again and would spend more money next time to find a better home with more amenities to host families.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
